("api/main-loop-running-p" :names ("main-loop-running-p") :kind :function :kind-name "Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Query wxAppConsole::IsMainLoopRunning. False during standalone pending dispatch, standalone GUI polling and the cooperative application REPL; those modes can still deliver callbacks. This is a main-loop query, not a callback-safety predicate." :position 35669)
